called a temperature.

00:09:40.590 --> 00:09:42.460
And the temperature
determines how

00:09:42.460 --> 00:09:46.300
creative the model decides to
be, how wacky it decides to be.

00:09:46.300 --> 00:09:47.790
And on one end of
the spectrum, we

00:09:47.790 --> 00:09:52.480
have extremely normal names,
names that show up repetitively

00:09:52.480 --> 00:09:54.290
