00:09:54.290 --> 00:09:56.110
And so they're kind of safe.

00:09:56.110 --> 00:09:58.450
And on the other side of
the temperature spectrum,

00:09:58.450 --> 00:10:00.940
you have really,
really creative names.

00:10:00.940 --> 00:10:02.612
You might have--
well, what might

00:10:02.612 --> 00:10:04.570
be viewed as misspellings,
but sometimes that's

00:10:04.570 --> 00:10:06.075
a good thing for companies.

00:10:06.075 --> 00:10:08.450
And you might have things that
just make no sense at all.

00:10:08.450 --> 00:10:11.090
And then in between, you
have in-between stuff.

