00:15:05.350 --> 00:15:07.330
So I've got the data.

00:15:07.330 --> 00:15:09.930
We dumped out of BigQuery.

00:15:09.930 --> 00:15:13.260
I did a little bit of
cleaning up on BigQuery.

00:15:13.260 --> 00:15:15.690
And the screen--

00:15:15.690 --> 00:15:17.610
