it into a Keras model

00:15:29.640 --> 00:15:32.850
to basically try to build a
model that can predict which

00:15:32.850 --> 00:15:37.750
quintile a given
company will be falling

00:15:37.750 --> 00:15:39.960
in given things like
what state it's in,

00:15:39.960 --> 00:15:42.990
the growth percentage, headcount
numbers, and its industry,

00:15:42.990 --> 00:15:44.490
and its revenue.

00:15:44.490 --> 00:15:47.280
And so I've processed
out the quintile.

00:15:47.280 --> 00:15:49.620
So I added the quintile
column in BigQuery

00:15:49.620 --> 00:15:53.160
to basically do a
