00:17:04.359 --> 00:17:08.150
And then I've got my training
input functions, et cetera.

00:17:08.150 --> 00:17:10.329
And then what I've
done here is I've

00:17:10.329 --> 00:17:13.300
used TensorFlow's feature
columns, which is a way

00:17:13.300 --> 00:17:15.730
