00:17:15.730 --> 00:17:19.540
I find that having the right
tool for the right task

00:17:19.540 --> 00:17:20.770
is really important.

00:17:20.770 --> 00:17:23.500
In BigQuery, making an
actual column for quintiles

00:17:23.500 --> 00:17:26.700
and doing a little bit of date
manipulation was really easy.

00:17:26.700 --> 00:17:28.900
And so I did it there
because it came to mind.

00:17:28.900 --> 00:17:30.610
But then as I went
through the process

00:17:30.610 --> 00:17:33.260
and I was [INAUDIBLE]
doing a few things there,

00:17:33.260 --> 00:17:36.040
those were the
